## Add Contributions

this file describes the Contributions feature.

1. It should open a Modal
2. The modal should have a close button
3. The modal should have "Depositar" as Title
4. It should require value and date
5. It should have a button with the title "Depositar"
6. After user clicks, modal should close
7. User should view the toast with the succes/error message 
8. it should post to '/contributions'
9. it should send "value" and savingJardId
